00:12:43,620 --> 00:12:50,020
not our friend at all
no turn the ship around

247
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:56,197
Sorry we can't help you
i know we said yes at

248
00:12:56,280 --> 00:12:57,817
first but we didn't
know this was the friend

249
00:12:57,900 --> 00:13:01,757
You were talking about
oh come on you can't just

250
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:04,487
leave him like this
after coming all this way

251
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:08,457
Please don't worry about
it Kuma just leave okay

252
00:13:08,540 --> 00:13:13,717
this is a trap this sucks
fine then i'll have to

253
00:13:13,800 --> 00:13:15,877
Do it i'm

254
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:22,137
in i never

255
00:13:22,220 --> 00:13:23,050
would have thought you guys

256
00:13:23,133 --> 00:13:25,825
would turn out to be such
a bunch of heartless?

257
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:28,680
Morons! Morons! Morons! Oh, shut up!

258
00:13:29,180 --> 00:13:30,880
Just hang on, Hachi!

259
00:13:31,100 --> 00:13:33,937
I promise you, we won't
leave this place without you!

260
00:13:34,020 --> 00:13:34,850
Here we come!

261
00:13:37,560 --> 00:13:39,040
We got you now, Amy!

262
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:41,637
You've gotta be kidding me!

263
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:42,955
That's just pathetic!

264
00:13:43,660 --> 00:13:45,719
Now we're all gonna be filthy rich!

265
00:13:45,880 --> 00:13:48,477
Especially since the only
guy who ever saves you, kid!

266
00:13:48,560 --> 00:13:50,697
You're not gonna escape
from us this time, Amy!

267
00:13:50,780 --> 00:13:51,610
It's over!

268
00:13:55,920 --> 00:13:58,360
Why didn't you just run away? Kuma!

269
00:13:59,140 --> 00:13:59,970
Papagoo!

270
00:14:00,640 --> 00:14:01,470
Bastards.

271
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:03,489
Kuma hasn't done anything.

272
00:14:03,640 --> 00:14:05,405
Sanji, hold on a second, okay?

273
00:14:15,660 --> 00:14:16,620
All right.

274
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:18,958
We might as well save him after all.

275
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:21,551
Sanji isn't all that bad.

276
00:14:21,700 --> 00:14:23,397
I'd go so far as to say he's harmless.

277
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:25,127
I'm not gonna hold a grudge.

278
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:28,475
And besides, we promised Kuma
we'd help her, didn't we?

279
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:29,790
Oh!

280
00:14:29,873 --> 00:14:30,720
Oh, Nami!

281
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:33,857
I love when you're firm, but I
love when you're forgiving, too!

282
00:14:33,940 --> 00:14:34,937
Are you sure, Nami?

283
00:14:35,020 --> 00:14:36,080
It's really okay.

284
00:14:37,280 --> 00:14:38,110
Yep.

285
00:14:38,193 --> 00:14:39,023
Right, Luffy?

286
00:14:39,106 --> 00:14:41,220
If you say it's okay, it's okay.

287
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:44,200
We'll save the octopus. Look!

288
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:46,260
His eyes are octopus fritters!

289
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:51,120
Are the preparations in order?

290
00:14:53,700 --> 00:14:55,260
Flying fish riders.

291
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:01,680
Of course, we're always ready!

292
00:15:01,820 --> 00:15:03,660
Time for Gump Gump!

293
00:15:04,820 --> 00:15:05,650
Pistons!

294
00:15:06,460 --> 00:15:08,200
You leave them alone!

295
00:15:10,780 --> 00:15:12,700
He's got Devil Fruit power!

296
00:15:14,260 --> 00:15:15,300
Straw head?

297
00:15:17,900 --> 00:15:19,680
Damn, that little bump!

298
00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:20,880
Thank you, Loopy!

299
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,620
You saved us! Yeah!

300
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,960
I got him, octopus!

301
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:27,000
Thank you, Straw Hat.

302
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:30,417
You have my most sincere
gratitude for saving little Kuma.

303
00:15:30,500 --> 00:15:31,700
I owe you one. Hey!

304
00:15:31,940 --> 00:15:34,646
Cut up the octopus's
cage and untie him, Zoro!

305
00:15:36,600 --> 00:15:37,430
Right.

306
00:15:37,520 --> 00:15:38,840
Be careful, Straw Hat.

307
00:15:39,020 --> 00:15:40,420
The trap is still set.

308
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:43,177
The Flying Fish Riders
have got you surrounded.

309
00:15:43,260 --> 00:15:45,237
They'll take you down any way they can.

310
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:46,849
Don't let your guard down.

311
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:47,840
Now attack.

312
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:49,250
Sir!

313
00:15:51,540 --> 00:15:52,716
You're the greatest.

314
00:15:54,100 --> 00:15:56,457
I don't care if they
come from the sea or sky.

315
00:15:56,540 --> 00:15:57,370
We'll be ready.

316
00:15:57,453 --> 00:15:59,276
We're gonna beat the crap out of them

317
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:17,497
Damn it quick while we
still have the chance.

318
00:16:17,580 --> 00:16:18,410
Come on.

319
00:16:18,493 --> 00:16:20,360
Let's go get Kuma back There.

320
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:23,640
Kuma, Pupaku, it's dangerous here.

321
00:16:23,760 --> 00:16:25,113
You need to stand back.

322
00:16:29,820 --> 00:16:31,600
Go, go, get a fish!

323
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:33,580
Go, go, get him back!

324
00:16:36,960 --> 00:16:38,360
Guys, they're here!

325
00:16:39,340 --> 00:16:40,170
Right.

326
00:17:02,100 --> 00:17:03,800
Let's get it, boys!

327
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:06,600
Fresh fish delivery!

328
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,824
Let's see, which one do I want?

329
00:17:11,220 --> 00:17:12,680
Okay, that one.

330
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:20,480
Here, fishy-fishy!

331
00:17:21,100 --> 00:17:22,280
My turn!

332
00:17:23,220 --> 00:17:24,050
Hey!

333
00:17:27,120 --> 00:17:29,200
Ooh, nice ride!

334
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:30,440
Look up!

335
00:17:31,780 --> 00:17:33,300
I'm flying!

336
00:17:34,500 --> 00:17:36,860
This is bad! What if he falls?

337
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:38,350
Whatever.

338
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:40,320
Try some of these!

339
00:17:42,840 --> 00:17:43,670
Uh-oh!

340
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:46,660
Damn it!

341
00:17:46,900 --> 00:17:48,717
They're gonna sink the ship at this rate!

342
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:49,682
That was close!

343
00:17:49,980 --> 00:17:54,257
Monks, if they hit a lady with one of
those bombs, then there'll be hell to pay.

344
00:17:54,340 --> 00:17:55,170
Love his tail!

345
00:17:55,300 --> 00:17:56,653
They'll get in the way!

346
00:17:58,180 --> 00:17:59,140
Everyone, dive!

347
00:17:59,860 --> 00:18:00,690
Roger!

348
00:18:08,840 --> 00:18:09,670
Luffy!

349
00:18:09,753 --> 00:18:10,680
Try not to drown!

350
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:13,510
Ah!

351
00:18:13,593 --> 00:18:14,423
Oh, come on!

352
00:18:16,180 --> 00:18:17,937
We're having a damn fight here!

353
00:18:18,020 --> 00:18:19,138
Don't screw around!

354
00:18:20,980 --> 00:18:21,810
Sorry.

355
00:18:23,120 --> 00:18:24,940
And you two were even worse.

356
00:18:25,140 --> 00:18:26,797
What the hell did you
think was going to happen?

357
00:18:26,880 --> 00:18:28,527
You have Devil Fruit powers.

358
00:18:30,580 --> 00:18:33,020
I was just trying to help.

359
00:18:34,840 --> 00:18:38,317
I'm sorry to have caused you
so much trouble, friends.

360
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,540
In the future,

361
00:18:39,820 --> 00:18:42,837
how about when we're in the
middle of a big dangerous fight,

362
00:18:42,920 --> 00:18:46,038
you don't try to drown
yourselves in the ocean, okay?

363
00:18:46,180 --> 00:18:48,415
Jeez, I should have let you guys sink.

364
00:18:51,640 --> 00:18:52,860
It's the Metro Gang.

365
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:54,200
Now's our chance.

366
00:18:54,340 --> 00:18:56,575
Get her while the Straw Hats are busy.

367
00:18:57,040 --> 00:19:00,628
Hey guys, stop drowning and get
over here to help us already.

368
00:19:04,700 --> 00:19:06,837
I thought I was going
to be in there forever.

369
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:07,750
Thanks.

370
00:19:07,833 --> 00:19:11,177
I know we got some bad blood between
us, but you're a great guy, Roronoa.

371
00:19:11,260 --> 00:19:12,090
Sure.

372
00:19:12,173 --> 00:19:14,440
I was just following orders, so... Wait!

373
00:19:17,120 --> 00:19:21,277
You butcher cowards, you used me like
a punching bag while I was tied up.

374
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:24,007
Do you really think I'm
gonna let that slide?

375
00:19:24,200 --> 00:19:27,340
You want another taste of
my fish bag karate? Fine!

376
00:19:27,580 --> 00:19:30,420
You don't scare me.
Want some? Bring it on!

377
00:19:31,260 --> 00:19:35,137
I admit, it was fun beating on you when
you were tied up and couldn't fight back.

378
00:19:35,220 --> 00:19:36,300
But I ain't picky.

379
00:19:36,480 --> 00:19:37,697
I'll beat on you any way you like.

380
00:19:37,780 --> 00:19:40,839
And if you got any requests,
direct them to my fist.

381
00:19:41,660 --> 00:19:46,620
My sword and my ancient goldfish
fighting style will rip you to pieces,

382
00:19:46,720 --> 00:19:48,838
and the sea will run red with blood.

383
00:19:52,660 --> 00:19:53,700
Take this!

384
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:59,980
We'll let you go this time.

385
00:20:01,320 --> 00:20:02,150
Punch it!

386
00:20:03,540 --> 00:20:04,500
Jamie! Papagoom!

387
00:20:04,840 --> 00:20:07,880
I'm so glad you're okay! Where are you?

388
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:10,517
I can't believe I got
captured by those idiots!

389
00:20:10,600 --> 00:20:12,417
I didn't want to put you in danger!

390
00:20:12,500 --> 00:20:13,330
It's fine!

391
00:20:13,413 --> 00:20:14,669
We're all safe now, right?

392
00:20:16,540 --> 00:20:17,420
Watch out!

393
00:20:18,100 --> 00:20:18,930
Hey, stupid!

394
00:20:19,080 --> 00:20:20,737
Did you forget about us already?

395
00:20:20,820 --> 00:20:23,617
If you want your buddy back,
you'll have to go through us!

396
00:20:23,700 --> 00:20:27,347
But good luck with that, because
you're in our territory, pal!

397
00:20:39,760 --> 00:20:45,740
You let your guard down too easily stay
back and leave this to us. Don't worry.

398
00:20:45,900 --> 00:20:47,606
We'll be done here in no time

399
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:50,640
It's like I owe you again, Roronoa.

400
00:20:50,760 --> 00:20:53,320
I'm so sorry for what I did to you before

401
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:59,224
Back when we fought I hurt you
pretty bad with my six sword style

402
00:20:59,320 --> 00:21:00,150
Oh, did you?

403
00:21:00,240 --> 00:21:02,197
Because I don't think
you hit me even once.

404
00:21:02,280 --> 00:21:03,110
You?

405
00:21:03,193 --> 00:21:04,023
Oh, I guess not.

406
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:06,137
All right, Chopper, line it up.

407
00:21:06,220 --> 00:21:08,540
Let's see how they like this. Fire!

408
00:21:12,780 --> 00:21:13,610
See that?

409
00:21:13,740 --> 00:21:15,800
Three in one shot! Bullseye!

410
00:21:16,200 --> 00:21:17,360
That was awesome!

411
00:21:18,460 --> 00:21:22,220
Any of you men got the
balls to do a zero fight?

412
00:21:22,480 --> 00:21:23,360
A zero fight?

413
00:21:24,380 --> 00:21:26,877
Interesting, but I don't know
if I'm up for the broken bones.

414
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:29,777
Does that mean you're going
to pay the medical bills?

415
00:21:29,860 --> 00:21:32,200
How does a million berries sound?

416
00:21:32,720 --> 00:21:33,550
Ah!

417
00:21:33,840 --> 00:21:34,840
I'll do it, head!

418
00:21:35,080 --> 00:21:36,260
Step back, boys!

419
00:21:36,560 --> 00:21:37,920
This is how it's done!

420
00:21:40,980 --> 00:21:43,040
Some big guy's coming right at us!

421
00:21:43,180 --> 00:21:44,840
He's got a huge club!

422
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:47,137
Yeah, and looks like he's not steering.

423
00:21:47,220 --> 00:21:51,161
Don't tell me the lunatic's trying
to crash straight into our ship.

424
00:21:51,860 --> 00:21:54,437
With that size and speed,
he'll end up sinking us.

425
00:21:54,520 --> 00:21:57,300
Luffy, you get the fish, okay?

426
00:21:58,420 --> 00:22:00,140
Yeah, no Bear Get ready!

427
00:22:00,380 --> 00:22:02,617
If you think you can stop
me, go ahead and try.

428
00:22:02,700 --> 00:22:04,876
But I'm slamming into you either way.

429
00:22:05,360 --> 00:22:06,190
Sanji's right.

430
00:22:06,273 --> 00:22:07,677
He's not turning away.

431
00:22:07,760 --> 00:22:08,757
No problem.

432
00:22:08,840 --> 00:22:11,840
Sure, he's fast, but if he flies into me.

433
00:22:12,720 --> 00:22:13,900
He's done for.

434
00:22:16,580 --> 00:22:17,980
Gump gump below.

435
00:22:33,120 --> 00:22:37,000
I know what we're having for
dinner. Oh, wow! It's huge!

436
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:39,911
It sure could have caused a lot of damage.

437
00:22:40,020 --> 00:22:43,077
Damn, these pirates are
putting up one hell of a fight.

438
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:44,177
Who would have thought?

439
00:22:44,260 --> 00:22:45,090
Ufa!

440
00:22:46,460 --> 00:22:48,519
There sure are a lot of those guys.

441
00:22:48,680 --> 00:22:49,510
That's annoying.

442
00:22:49,593 --> 00:22:52,717
How many of them do you think we have
to beat before they just give up?

443
00:22:52,800 --> 00:22:53,630
Ah!

444
00:22:53,713 --> 00:22:55,117
I want to ride! What?!

445
00:22:55,200 --> 00:22:58,057
Don't think I'm gonna stop trying
because of what happened last time!

446
00:22:58,140 --> 00:22:59,277
Are you out of your mind?

447
00:22:59,360 --> 00:23:01,301
I'm not swimming after you again!

448
00:23:02,560 --> 00:23:03,600
How devastating.

449
00:23:04,220 --> 00:23:05,161
Come on, Brooke.

450
00:23:05,340 --> 00:23:06,170
What's wrong?

451
00:23:06,980 --> 00:23:11,568
To think that in my first battle as a
member of the crew, all I did was drown.

452
00:23:12,660 --> 00:23:16,072
If I cannot right this wrong,
how can I call myself a man?

453
00:23:16,700 --> 00:23:19,120
I wonder how many I can strike down.

454
00:23:19,620 --> 00:23:22,257
I am of meager talent,
but I shall do my best!

455
00:23:22,340 --> 00:23:24,380
Stand back and observe.

456
00:23:32,700 --> 00:23:34,417
What's with the weird skeleton mask?

457
00:23:34,500 --> 00:23:36,400
I'll run him straight through!

458
00:23:49,120 --> 00:23:49,950
You, too!

459
00:23:54,500 --> 00:23:56,720
Music is power!

460
00:23:57,700 --> 00:23:58,530
Come on!

461
00:24:00,040 --> 00:24:01,460
I fell asleep!

462
00:24:04,240 --> 00:24:06,357
What the hell kind of move was that?

463
00:24:06,440 --> 00:24:09,734
I don't know, but whatever
it was, it was a dirty trick.

464
00:24:09,900 --> 00:24:11,840
It wasn't a trick at all, sir.

465
00:24:12,840 --> 00:24:14,060
It was music!

466
00:24:16,380 --> 00:24:18,197
Get back here! Not bad!

467
00:24:18,280 --> 00:24:19,440
It's like fun, too.

468
00:24:19,800 --> 00:24:21,440
I gotta step things up.

469
00:24:22,780 --> 00:24:24,520
Oh, no, not again.

470
00:24:24,760 --> 00:24:25,760
Loopy, come back!

471
00:24:28,280 --> 00:24:29,460
Now I got you.

472
00:24:29,620 --> 00:24:30,800
Hey, don't die.

473
00:24:31,060 --> 00:24:32,472
I'll smash your head in.

474
00:24:33,640 --> 00:24:34,660
Are you kidding?

475
00:24:34,960 --> 00:24:35,880
He's asleep?

476
00:24:36,120 --> 00:24:37,708
Wake up, we're gonna crash!

477
00:24:42,120 --> 00:24:45,120
That punk, he crashed
straight into the heads room.

478
00:25:10,160 --> 00:25:12,020
You saw, didn't you?

479
00:25:12,380 --> 00:25:13,280
No way!

480
00:25:17,020 --> 00:25:19,600
A familiar face, huh?
